<& /page/page_title.mas, title => "<a href=\"http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/\">SolCyc</a> 生物化學途徑(Biochemical Pathways)" &>

<div class="boxbgcolor1">
<p>
SolCyc 是茄科物種途徑基因體資料庫 (PGDBs) 的集合，使用來自 <a href="http://www.sri.com">SRI International</a> 的 <a href="http://bioinformatics.ai.sri.com/ptools/">Pathway Tools</a> 軟體產生，該軟體亦用於阿拉伯芥 (<i>Arabidopsis thaliana</i>) 的 <a href="http://www.arabidopsis.org/tools/aracyc/">AraCyc</a> 和大腸桿菌 (<i>E. coli</i>) 的 <a href="http://www.ecocyc.org">EcoCyc</a>。(SolCyc is a collection of Pathway Genome Databases (PGDBs) for Solanaceae species generated using <a href="http://bioinformatics.ai.sri.com/ptools/">Pathway Tools</a> software from <a href="http://www.sri.com">SRI International</a>, the same software that is used in <a href="http://www.arabidopsis.org/tools/aracyc/">AraCyc</a> for <i>Arabidopsis thaliana</i> and <a href="http://www.ecocyc.org">EcoCyc</a> for <i>E. coli</i>.)
</p>
<p>
目前提供從各自基因體註解產生的番茄、馬鈴薯和甜椒資料庫。經過重大策展的資料庫標記為 <span class="tier">TIER 1</span>。茄子資料庫已不再支援或提供。(Currently, databases for tomato, potato, and pepper are available, generated from the respective genome annotations. Databases that have received significant curation are marked with a <span class="tier">TIER 1</span>. The eggplant database is not longer supported or available.)
</p>


<h4>物種專一性資料庫(Species-specific databases):</h4>
<ul>
  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=LYCO"><b>番茄(Tomato)</b> <i>Solanum lycopersicum</i> (LycoCyc)</a> </li>
  
  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/POTATO/server.html"><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=POTATO"><b>馬鈴薯(Potato)</b> <i>Solanum tuberosum</i> (PotatoCyc)</a></li>
  
  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=CAP"><b>甜椒(Pepper)</b> <i>Capsicum annuum</i> (CapCyc)</a></li>
  
  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=COFFEA"><b>咖啡(Coffee)</b> <i>Coffea arabica</i> (CoffeaCyc)</a></li>
  
  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=PET"><b>矮牽牛(Petunia)</b> <i>Petunia hybrida</i> (PetCyc)</a></li>

  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=TobaccoCyc"><b>菸草(Tobacco)</b> <i>Nicotiana tabacum</i> (K326Cyc)</a> <span class="tier">TIER 1</span></li>
  
  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=NATT"><i>Nicotiana attenuata</i> (NattCyc)</a> <span class="tier">TIER 1</span></li>

  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=NISYL"><i>Nicotiana sylvestris</i> (NiSylCyc)</a> <span class="tier">TIER 1</span></li>

  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object=NITOM"><i>Nicotiana tomentosiformis</i> (NiTomCyc)</a></li>

 </ul>
<h4>多物種資料庫(Multi-species databases):</h4>
<ul>
  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object="><b>菸草(Tobacco)</b> 綜合菸草屬資料庫(Combined Nicotiana genus) (NicotianaCyc)</a> <span class="tier">TIER 1</span></li>
  <li><a target="_blank" href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/organism-summary?object="><b>茄科(Solanaceae)</b> 綜合茄科資料庫(Combined Solanaceae database) (SolanaCyc)</a> <span class="tier">TIER 1</span></li>
</ul>

<p>
未來將建立更多資料庫，並透過增加更多茄科特異性途徑來改進註解。(More databases will be generated in the future, and the annotation will be improved by adding more Solanaceae specific pathways.)
</p>
<p>
請注意 <a href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/expression.html">組學檢視器(Omics viewer)</a> 的可用性，它允許將微陣列、基因晶片、蛋白質組學和代謝組學資訊覆蓋在途徑概覽圖上。(Note the availability of the <a href="http://solcyc.solgenomics.net/expression.html">Omics viewer</a>, which allows microarray, gene chip, proteomics, and metabolomic information to be overlaid over the pathway overview diagrams.)
</p>
</div>


<b>Pathway Tools 的程式介面(Programmatic interfaces for Pathway Tools)</b>:<br />
我們目前為 Pathway Tools 維護一個 Perl 介面和一個 Java 介面：(We currently maintain a Perl interface and a Java interface for Pathway Tools:)
<a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/programs/javacyc/javacyc.tar.gz">JavaCyc</a> 與(and) <a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/programs/perlcyc/perlcyc.tar.gz">PerlCyc</a>。更多資訊可在 <a href="/downloads/">軟體下載(software downloads)</a> 頁面取得。(More information is available on the <a href="/downloads/">software downloads</a> page.)

};
